{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16997","headline":"送许着作分司东都 · 武元衡","name":"送许着作分司东都","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"瑶瑟激凄响，征鸿翻夕阳。\n署分刊竹简，书蠹护芸香。\n马色关城晓，蝉声驿路长。\n石渠荣正礼，兰室重元方。\n不作经年别，离魂亦暂伤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16997.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16997","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}